%% the spec says [term()], antidote_ets_meta_data:create_remote_meta_data_table/1 takes the name as an atom(); start_link/1
%% passes one. Behind it the clause takes [Name], a list of one element (flag)
{exception, meta_data_manager, init, 1, [ignore], source_bug}.
